### Key Notes
| Case | Handled? |
|---|---|
| Duplicates (e.g. `{5, 5, 3}`) | ✅ Returns `3` |
| All same elements (e.g. `{4, 4, 4}`) | ✅ Throws exception |
| Array with < 2 elements | ✅ Throws exception |

**Recommended:** Use **Approach 1** (single pass) for best performance in interviews and production.